# Code Quality

- Fully typed TypeScript; prefer small, modular, documented components.
- Tailwind only with approved tokens: cream backgrounds, lavender primary, amber accents, soft shadows, `rounded-2xl`.
- Prefer semantic utility groups over one-off hex sprawl; centralize tokens in theme/CSS variables when adding new surfaces.
- No curriculum strings or lesson IDs hardcoded in components — import from JSON / typed content modules.
- Keep interaction engines pure: props in → UI + callbacks out; side effects (audio, persistence) via hooks/adapters.
